  # Why: Just-inside the narration cache freshness window — replay is served from cache, not re-synthesised (ADR-POC-015 Decision 5)
  # [ASSUMPTION: confidence=medium] ASSUM-004 — a synthesised narration is cached for 15 minutes, keyed to the transaction and the rules in force (ASSUM-005)
  @boundary
  Scenario: A narration replayed within its freshness window is served from cache
    Given I heard the narration for a flag 14 minutes ago
    And the donor's rules have not changed since
    When I ask to hear that narration again
    Then I should hear the cached narration without it being produced again

  # Why: Just-outside the narration cache freshness window — a stale narration is produced again
  @boundary
  Scenario: A narration replayed after its freshness window is produced again
    Given I heard the narration for a flag 16 minutes ago
    When I ask to hear that narration again
    Then the narration should be produced again

